<title>UK: Banco SudAmerica unit sets $75 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco SudAmerica unit sets $75 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TABRIZA (CAYMAN) INVESTMENTS LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     9.75	MATURITY    21.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.74     PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    99.74     SPREAD	+325 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG	 MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC   0.50</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5-YEAR UST</p>
<p> NOTES	TABRIZA IS A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDARY OF BANCO</p>
<p>		SUDAMERICA</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>	    -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
